    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikisa Yosia akilip nakuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai erwosit Yosia kiyakiya tocunut neni keŋ ŋikasikou alo Yudaya a daadaŋ ka ŋulu a Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit kitipeiyo Kai ka Akuj, torukosi ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu a Yudaya ka ŋulu a Yerusalem daadaŋ. Torukosi iŋes ka ŋisacaradotin, ŋikadwarak ta ŋituŋa daadaŋ, ŋulu ecarioko kaapei ka ŋikarwok. Tosyom iŋes alokiŋaren kec ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna egiritae lokitaabo ŋolo ka Acamunet, ŋolo aponi torukaunae alotooma Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towo erwosit Yosia alodiyete epir, kikoŋ alokiŋaren Ekapolon akiwuapit iŋes, akiricakinit ŋakiciketa keŋ, ŋakiro keŋ ka ŋikisila keŋ a etau keŋ a daadaŋ ta akitiya ŋuna daadaŋ igiritae lokitaabo ŋol. Tosodo ŋituŋa daadaŋ kiikis akiwuap Acamunet ŋin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok erwosit Yosia Ilikia esacaradoti ŋolo apolon nooi ka ŋisacaradotin ŋulu ewuapito ŋulu apolok ta ŋituŋa ŋulu apolokinito etic alo Kai ka Akuj akipudun alo Kai ka Akuj ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu etiyaunitae aŋuna a Baal ka Asera ta ŋiboorei ŋulu ecayete alokidiama. Kicunyak iŋes ikes daadaŋ alokiŋa etaun Yerusalem alotooma ayonae ŋina enyaritae Kidiron, ido kisiwoko ŋituŋa ekuron kec Besel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirita iŋes ŋisacaradotin ŋulu a ŋakujo a ŋun, ŋisacaradotin ŋulu kepotu ŋirwosi a Yudaya kiwuakis aŋuna ka ainanakin ŋainanakineta anenimukur, aneni ilipere ŋakujo alotaunio a Yudaya ka alo Yerusalem, ŋulu ainanakinete ŋainanakineta neni a Baal, neni ka akoloŋ, neni ke elap, neni a ŋirematom ka neni a ŋitopon ka neni a ŋiboorei a ŋic a ŋulu ecayete alokidiama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipud Yosia alo Kai ka Akuj etorube ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera, yau kiŋa Yerusalem, nayonae Kidiron, tosodi kicunyak. Ani irikakin kicakicak toruwor apuwa, ido kieliyelak apuwa ŋin nalyalin a ŋituŋa ca a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kituwono iŋes ŋakais ŋuna a ŋikilyok a ŋulu erae ŋimalaae, eboiyete alo Kai ka Akuj. Arae tooma ŋakais ŋun adonyoto ŋaberu ŋilowi ŋulu elipere neni ka Asera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau iŋes ŋisacaradotin alotaunio a Yudaya a daadaŋ, ido tomunaiyana ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur neni sek ainanankineta ŋisacaradotin ŋainanakineta neni a ŋakujo. Tomunaiya iŋes ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur alo Geba akitodol Beeriseba. Tobwaŋabwaŋaya ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur alopukei a ŋulu aya lopuke ŋolo aduli Yosua ŋolo apolokinit etaun, aya ŋaduketa ŋun alowae a ŋolo alokedyeny epuke ŋolo ke etaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa aponeneete ŋisacaradotin ŋulu a ŋakujo a ŋuna gelae Namuroet ŋina ke Ekapolon ŋina ayai Yerusalem, emujeneneete ikes aneni a ŋiyeneta kec ŋamugati ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosia tomunaiya Topes, namuroet ŋina adukokinitae nayonae ŋina anyaritae Ben-Inom, todaun nabo epite ŋolo apedoria idiotuŋanan akiar lokoku keŋ. kori nakoku keŋ kicunyak erae ainakinet neni ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema iŋes ŋitorubei a ŋaŋolei ŋulu sek etowoikinito ŋirwosi a Yudaya lokek ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj, ŋuna etaleoritae neni ka akoloŋ, torae alodiyete akai ŋina a ekolup a ŋolo anyaritae Nasan Melek, akai ŋina ayai narwatata. Kicunyak iŋes ŋagaari ŋuna elipere akoloŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ŋamuroeta ŋuna aya nagule ŋina alokidiama akai ka Aas, Ŋamuroeta ŋuna adukete ŋirwosi a Yudaya ka ŋuna aduki Manase nalapatui ŋunaarei ŋuna ka Akai ka Akuj, abu Yosia toukono, tobwaŋabwaŋa, tosodi tobukono ŋakielet nayonae Kidiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomunaiya iŋes ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur Kide Yerusalem, ŋuna elipere ŋakujo ka ŋuna aya alowae a ŋolo alo kwap emukura ŋolo enyaritae emukura ŋolo ka Akinyasuno (Iŋes emukura ŋolo a ŋikito ka Olipa). Arae sek Solomon ŋolo arae erwosit a Isirael iŋes aduki ŋaduketa ŋun aŋuna ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asitarite a ŋina a Ŋisidoniae ka Kemos akuj a Ŋimoabi ta Milikon akuj a Ŋiamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosia toukono ŋitorubeei a ŋakujo, totubutubu ŋipirin ŋul, kililyaa ŋapanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosia touko tari namuroet ŋina ayai nenimukur alo Besel, ŋina aduki Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat ŋolo arikokini Ŋisirael nasecit, abu Yosia touko ibore daadaŋ kiela. Kicuny iŋes aduketait ŋin kicakicak ŋiboro ŋulu adukitere toruwor ŋalup, kicuny iŋes tari etorube ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, toboboŋ Yosia kiŋolik ŋalyalin ŋuna aya epeiwae emukura. Kiyakiya iŋes ŋituŋa alosit akipudunun ŋakoyo kiŋa. Abu iŋes kicunyak ŋakoyo ŋun anamuroet a ŋina ayai nen, ikotere inyasi namuroet ŋin lopite ŋolo alimokinitor Ekapolon iŋes anakituk a ŋina ke ekadwaran a ŋolo abu todwar ŋakiro ŋun. Ani eyakaun ŋasuban, abu Yeroboam towo alodiyete namuroet, kireo neni ayai alyal ŋina ke ekadwaran a ŋolo kedwari ŋakiro ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kiŋit ŋituŋa tema, “Erae nyo aduketait a ŋamoru ŋina ete ayoŋ ŋin?” Toboŋokis ŋituŋa ŋulu ke etaun iŋes temasi “Erae alyal ŋina ke ekadwaran a ŋolo abuni alo Yudaya todwar ŋakiro ŋuna itiya iyoŋ namuroet ŋina alo Besel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu iŋes tema, “Kimyekisi iŋes kieŋu; nyelema idiotuŋanan ŋakoyo keŋ.” Toesikis nai ikes ŋakoyo keŋ ka ŋuna ke ekadwaran a ŋolo kebuni alo Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema Yosia ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur ŋuna elipere ŋakujo alotaunio a Samaria a daadaŋ, ŋaduketa ŋuna sek kedukete ŋirwosi a Isirael, ŋuna keponeta kitoŋaeta nooi Ekapolon. Abu iŋes tomunaiya ŋaduketa ŋun lopite ŋolopei abunio tomunaayrya ŋuna sek aya Besel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toar iŋes ŋisacaradotin ŋulu a ŋaduketa aŋuna aya nenimukur a nen daadaŋ, tosodi kicunyak ŋakoyo a ŋituŋa alokidiama ŋamuroeta ŋun. Toboŋo nai Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kinumunumae ŋasuban a Paska",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit Yosia tolimok ŋituŋa tema, “Kiwuapito etal ŋolo a Paska a Ekapolon Akuj kus lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokitaabo alo a ŋolo ka acamunet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amam Paska ace sek ŋina enuminumitae ameun alorwa a ŋulu epukatotor ŋikatubok Isirael ka daŋ alorwa a daadaŋ a ŋulu epukatotor ŋirwosi Isirael ka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni ipukat Yosia, aponi kinumunumae ŋasuban a Paska alo Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
